<title>USA: CalEnergy completes $225 million note offer.</title>
<headline>CalEnergy completes $225 million note offer.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalEnergy Co Inc said Friday it completed a private institutional offering of $225 million aggregate principal amount of 9.5 percent senior notes, due 2006.</p>
<p>The proceeds will be used to make equity investments in future domestic and international energy projects, to fund possible project or company acquisitions, to repay debt, and for other general corporate purposes, CalEnergy said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
